  "ingredients": [
    "1 large russet potato, peeled",
    "1 teaspoon plant-based butter (such as Country Crock®)",
    "2 tablespoons diced onions",
    "1 clove garlic, minced",
    "0.25 cup plant-based butter (such as Country Crock®)",
    "2 tablespoons unsweetened, plain almond milk",
    "salt and ground black pepper to taste",
    "6 corn tortillas",
    "avocado oil cooking spray"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WXcvOPm1cV-jYwVP33Jt_tHRFrg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-279013-vegan-air-fryer-taquitos-VAT-step-01-94d3f1d0b4644d88840c7faf48faa840.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279013/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Place potato into a saucepan and cover with salted water; bring to a boil. Reduce the heat to medium-low and simmer until tender, about 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/ESuale3XzkPkXvRxDvlXDyaYPfQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-279013-vegan-air-fryer-taquitos-VAT-step-02-1df5d1dd79b54f39b9dc09607f0b4d0c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279013/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Meanwhile, melt 1 teaspoon plant-based butter in a skillet. Add onion and sauté until soft and translucent, 3 to 5 minutes. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, about 1 minute. Remove from the heat and set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/tZJpOsNEgGG-7Su_AwqJ2ZrJ-XI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-279013-vegan-air-fryer-taquitos-VAT-step-03-74390d4faf7a4b608e2021e836cffc2c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279013/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Drain potato and transfer to a bowl. Add 1/4 cup plant-based butter and almond milk, season with salt and pepper, and mash. Mix in onion and garlic until well combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fPR4FlhN93RHFBcJpHkPIokqK7E=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-279013-vegan-air-fryer-taquitos-VAT-step-04-6ff2fce650474c78b8e79ea89d2c643e.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279013/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Heat tortillas in a skillet or directly over the grates of a gas stove until soft and pliable. Place 3 tablespoons of potato mixture down the center of each tortilla, fold over, and roll up.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/M4GELBmTs4_FoZzdo_SAxrOLhFI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-279013-vegan-air-fryer-taquitos-VAT-step-05-ade534e349cd46b8bacf7ad0cd51244c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279013/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat an air fryer to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Place taquitos into the air fryer basket, making sure they don't touch; mist with avocado oil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/eeLtk8E7wS1RZeM45og5wGpvU_0=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-279013-vegan-air-fryer-taquitos-VAT-step-06-99eb43157fe64a3783d1c138e1d705be.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279013/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Working in batches if necessary, air-fry taquitos until golden brown and crispy, 6 to 9 minutes. Flip taquitos, mist with avocado oil, and air-fry for 3 to 5 more minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QSLpFvyblaS0sia4UbmbsvCxHJI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-279013-vegan-air-fryer-taquitos-VAT-step-07-1745a8fc89e0489b98cea86442732922.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/279013/step_07.webp"
    }
  ],
